            new("help", "help", ["search", "theme", "pagehelp", "help"], "Search, language, theme and help",
                "Use the search at the top to find a page or a question (for example, temperature), and the round buttons to change the language and the theme. The \"?\" button next to the title opens the current page's help. This Help Center is at the end of the menu and has the Retake the tour button."),
